Photographs, poems and marks

The MIT license above covers the code. It does not cover the content below,
which is Copyright (c) Yūnus Andréasson, all rights reserved. You may not
copy, publish, sell or adapt it without written permission
(yunus@edenmind.com).

- The photographs. They are not in this repository (photos/ is outside git),
  but images made from them are: the link previews in public/og/ and the
  screenshots in .github/readme/.
- The poems and their year titles in src/content/poems/, and their link
  previews in public/og/poems/ and public/og/poems.jpg.
- The list of birds seen in src/content/birds/species.json. The names and
  their order follow the Swedish list, as the Birds page says.
- The name Andrèasson Photo and its icons: public/favicon.svg,
  public/apple-touch-icon.png, public/icon-192.png and public/icon-512.png.

The screenshots in src/assets/code/ show other websites as they looked when
they were taken. What appears on them belongs to those sites; on
markarydsfagelklubb.nu, to Markaryds Fågelklubb, its members and its
sponsors.

Third-party fonts

src/assets/fonts/ holds subsets of two typefaces under the SIL Open Font
License 1.1 (https://openfontlicense.org), which travels with them in each
file's name table:

- Cormorant Garamond, Copyright 2015 the Cormorant Project Authors
  (github.com/CatharsisFonts/Cormorant)
- EB Garamond, Copyright 2017 The EB Garamond Project Authors
  (github.com/octaviopardo/EBGaramond12)
